 "integration": {
  "summary": "Command occupancy (BV 23) and, if the BMS owns start/stop, Remote Off (BV 22). Write the occupied space temperature and RH setpoints (AV 24, AV 23) and the unoccupied ones if used (AV 26, AV 25). If the heartbeat is enabled (BV 26), toggle BV 27 within the delay set in AV 29. Monitor Unit Status (AV 1001), space conditions and Active Alarm (BV 8, inverted).",
  "minimum_points": [
   {
    "ref": "BV 22",
    "name": "Remote Off",
    "why": "Unit off command (1 = off, 0 = on)"
   },
   {
    "ref": "BV 23",
    "name": "Network Occupied Input",
    "why": "Occupancy command (1 = occupied)"
   },
   {
    "ref": "AV 24",
    "name": "Network Zone Temperature Setpoint",
    "why": "Occupied space temperature setpoint, °F"
   },
   {
