  "enable": "BV 22 Remote Off turns the unit off when set to 1 and back on at 0. BV 23 Network Occupied Input selects occupied (1) or unoccupied (0); BV 7 confirms the occupied state. BV 25 Blower Continuous switches the blower between automatic and continuous.",
  "heartbeat": "Optional. Write BV 26 Network Heartbeat Enable = 1 to turn it on, then toggle BV 27 Network Heartbeat between 1 and 0 within the delay in AV 29 (1-999 s, default 120 s). The list does not say what the unit does when the heartbeat stops.",
  "remote_sensors": "The BMS can send zone temperature (AV 27) and zone RH (AV 28). AV 1002 Zone Sensor Status shows which sensor is in use (0 = unit sensor, 1 = BMS, 2 = lead unit).",
